Come to think of it, she'd barely spoken to me at all\ntoday. And she didn't even drink anything... though I\nguess there was an obvious reason for that.%K%P
说起来她今天好像没怎么说过话。\n连酒也一口都没有…不，那是自然的吧。%K%P
In any case, I was expecting her to find some way to\nverbally abuse me again over my new job, but...%K%P
因为说了是我的庆祝会，\n还以为她会各种刁难我呢。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
