%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dOh.\d%K%P
「哎呀」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dH-Hello...\d%K%P
「你、你好…」%K%P
She seemed to have sensed my worries about how to approach\nher, which prompted her to come outside as I was dallying\nin front of Mitoko's room.%K%P
一边思考着该如何与姬绪谈话，\n一边在美都子房间前踱步的时候，\n就这样如我所愿地撞见了啊…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI could've sworn I heard someone prowling outside the\ndoor, and it seems I was right.\d%K%P
「我还以为走廊那边的奇怪声音是什么呢…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「…非常抱歉」%K%P
Or perhaps it was just an unwelcome necessity.%K%P
虽然我是这么想的，不过这只是给人添了麻烦而产生的必然吧。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dToko is not in. ...Not that I would let you into a girl's\nroom in the middle of the night even if she was.\d%K%P
「小都子不在里面哦。\n…不过，就算她在，我也不会让你这么轻易在晚上侵入女子房间的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, I was actually looking for you this time, not\nMitoko.\d%K%P
「不，今天我不是来找美都子，\n而是找姬绪小姐…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dMe?\d%K%P
「找我？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI wanted to thank you for giving me this chance.\d%K%P
「那个…想要感谢你让我再次就职」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou've done more things for me than I can count. And\nthanks to you, I think I might have finally found stable\nemployment.\d%K%P
「这次的事情，各方面都受你关照了。\n托你的福，这次我终于能好好工作了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dH-How did you know?! Who told you...?\d%K%P
「为、为什么察觉到了！？\n到底是从谁那里得到的消息？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt was all over the papers, and online too. They weren't\nfront-page articles or anything, but still...\d%K%P
「已经记载在网络和报纸上了。\n虽然很不起眼」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dS-Seriously? They already caught wind of it? We only\n-just- finalized the deal!\d%K%P
「不、不是吧？\n已经刊登了吗？\n明明只是早上才刚决定的？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, I suppose absorbing Michihama Trading is nothing\noverly significant for the Sawashima Group, but...\d%K%P
「那个，虽然在泽嶋房地产看来，\n吸收道浜商事只是一件小事…？」%K%P
