After that...%K%P
那之后…%K%P
...we listened to another two hours of Mitoko's lecturing\nwhile being made to sit in her room on our heels.%K%P
我们两人，在美都子的房间被迫正座着，\n又承受了差不多两小时的说教。%K%P
I couldn't understand it... I'd called her properly by her\nfirst name and everything.%K%P
真奇怪啊…\n我们明明有好好用对方名字来彼此问候的。%K%P
